{0 GdkPixbuf classes and records}

{!Ocgdkpixbuf} has one module for each GdkPixbuf class and record, with the externals they are built on in {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Raw}, the enumerations and bitfields in {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Enums} and the constants in {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Constants}. See {%html:<a href="../ocgtk/conventions.html">the conventions page</a>%} for how the bindings are organised: the two layers, the anatomy of a class module, and how names, types, signals and properties are mapped.

